href=\"/Genesis.23.7\">Gn 23:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:10\" href=\"/Exodus.33.10\">Ex 33:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 20:41\" href=\"/I_Samuel.20.41\">1 S 20:41</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:41\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.41\">25:41</a>;—(v. also <strong>e</strong>); from kneeling (<span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span>, + <span dir=\"rtl\">מִלִּפְנֵי</span> loc.) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:54\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.54\">1 K 8:54</a>, from obeisance <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:42\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.42\">1 S 25:42</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:4\" href=\"/Esther.8.4\">Est 8:4</a>; from bending over <span dir=\"rtl\">(עַל)</span> dead <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:3\" href=\"/Genesis.23.3\">Gn 23:3</a> (P)."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"out of <span dir=\"rtl\">(מִן)</span> a condition, state, <a data-ref=\"Ezra 9:5\" href=\"/Ezra.9.5\">Ezr 9:5</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of bear <em>rising</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers., <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 17:35\" href=\"/I_Samuel.17.35\">1 S 17:35</a>."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>arise</em> (+ stand) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 33:8\" href=\"/Exodus.33.8\">Ex 33:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 20:9\" href=\"/Psalms.20.9\">ψ 20:9</a> (fig. of success, prosperity), <a data-ref=\"Job 24:22\" href=\"/Job.24.22\">Jb 24:22</a> (id.), +; of sheaf <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:7\" href=\"/Genesis.37.7\">Gn 37:7</a>; of waters <a data-ref=\"Joshua 3:16\" href=\"/Joshua.3.16\">Jos 3:16</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(נֵד־אֶחָד)</span>."}],"num":"d."},{"senses":[{"definition":"constr. praegn. <em>arise</em> (and stand) for a purpose <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:32\" href=\"/Numbers.11.32\">Nu 11:32</a> (E); <em>over</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers., <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.17\">2 S 12:17</a>."}],"num":"e."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>arise</em> as prelim. to formal speech <a data-ref=\"Judges 20:8\" href=\"/Judges.20.8\">Ju 20:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 6:1\" href=\"/Micah.6.1\">Mi 6:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 1:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.1.17\">Je 1:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.2\">1 Ch 28:2</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(עַל־רַגְלָיו)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:28\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.28\">Pr 31:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:28\" href=\"/Job.30.28\">Jb 30:28</a> + 5 times; to testify (against) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.15\">Dt 19:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:16\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.19.16\">16</a> (both ב pers.), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 27:12\" href=\"/Psalms.27.12\">ψ 27:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 35:11\" href=\"/Psalms.35.11\">35:11</a>, cf. also <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּקָם בִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 16:8\" href=\"/Job.16.8\">Jb 16:8</a> (of <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּחַשׁ</span> q.v.; Bu <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּעַשׂ</span>); to vindicate <a data-ref=\"Job 19:25\" href=\"/Job.19.25\">Jb 19:25</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(עַל־עָפָר)</span>; to read aloud <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.3\">Ne 9:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(עַל־עָמְדָם)</span>; to bless people <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 30:27\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.30.27\">2 Ch 30:27</a> (priests)."}],"num":"f."},{"senses":[{"definition":"to listen to God’s word <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:18\" href=\"/Numbers.23.18\">Nu 23:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 32:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.32.9\">Is 32:9</a>; to praise God <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:19\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.19\">2 Ch 20:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:4\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.4\">Ne 9:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 9:5\" href=\"/Nehemiah.9.5\">5</a>."}],"num":"g."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of noise, tumult <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:14\" href=\"/Hosea.10.14\">Ho 10:14</a>; of light <a data-ref=\"Job 25:3\" href=\"/Job.25.3\">Jb 25:3</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers.)."}],"num":"h."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>arise</em>, in hostile sense (often with idea of suddenness); c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 19:11\" href=\"/Deuteronom